e is what governance, risk, and legal leaders must track today:\n\n🚨 Supply Chain Breach Hits AI Infrastructure: LiteLLM\nAttackers https://t.co/TN2kVpx5Qz", "url": "https://x.com/MikeScott614/status/2113640031197753604"}, {"author_id": "14739100", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113013203558916178"], "id": "2113013203558916178", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 161, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Critical infra and defense cannot export telemetry to public clouds for frontier AI.\nGoogle Distributed Cloud announced air-gapped Blackwell Ultra acceleration, local Gemini, and turnkey ISV apps.\nHow do you balance data sovereignty with frontier AI compute?", "url": "https://x.com/solsona/status/2113013203558916178"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113053394961141760"]}, "author_id": "1234260054368342016", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:44:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113053804945908107"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/apHKlzlcTQ", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/theallinpod/status/2113053804945908107/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113053394961141760", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/apHKlzlcTQ"}]}, "id": "2113053804945908107", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 162, "impression_count": 42409, "like_count": 344, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 34}, "text": "All-In Interview : IBM CEO, Arvind Krishna &amp; Palo Alto Networks CEO, Nikesh Arora\n\n-- Quantum Computing’s Threat to Encryption\n\n-- Open Weight vs. Frontier AI Models\n\n-- AI and Cyber Warfare\n\n-- Vertical Integration and the Return of the Conglomerate\n\n-- The Future of SaaS\n\n++ https://t.co/apHKlzlcTQ", "url": "https://x.com/theallinpod/status/2113053804945908107"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2113481401450274816"]}, "author_id": "2106630980241162240", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:03:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet