.com/jrFoUWb0EG", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/VMware/status/2113251078837846119/video/1", "media_key": "7_2113251024966160385", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/jrFoUWb0EG"}]}, "id": "2113251078837846119", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1177, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Humans take breaks. Frontier AI-driven attacks don’t.\n\nAs Chris McCain explains, non-stop attacks require defenses that operate at machine speed.\n\nSee how @VMware_vDefend &amp; @AviNetworks deliver multi-layer defense for the Frontier AI era: https://t.co/4wgxCBI1T1 https://t.co/jrFoUWb0EG", "url": "https://x.com/VMware/status/2113251078837846119"}, {"author_id": "50766916", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:47:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113054535652692065"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Microsoft launched Guardian Agents to monitor autonomous AI tools and prevent rogue behaviors in enterprise systems.", "display_url": "androidheadlines.com/2026/10/micros…", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://www.androidheadlines.com/2026/10/microsoft-ai-agent-security-tools.html", "images": [{"height": 900, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113054599582306304/wFCy2r5C?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113054599582306304/wFCy2r5C?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 89, "status": 200, "title": "Microsoft Says Frontier AI Models Can No Longer Be Trusted, Launches Security Watchdogs", "unwound_url": "https://www.androidheadlines.com/2026/10/microsoft-ai-agent-security-tools.html", "url": "https://t.co/tUDbBQfA4Q"}]}, "id": "2113054535652692065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 550, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Microsoft Says Frontier AI Models Can No Longer Be Trusted, Launches Security Watchdogs\n\nhttps://t.co/tUDbBQfA4Q", "url": "http